[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441934597","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/3800#issuecomment-441934597","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/3800","id":441934597,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ0MTkzNDU5Nw==","user":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-09-19T22:34:38Z","updated_at":"2018-11-27T06:01:32Z","body":"**Michael Bayer ([@zzzeek](https://github.com/zzzeek)) wrote:**\n\nwell, do it like this so your expression is a first class mapping:\n\n\n```\nclass A(Base):\n    __tablename__ = 'a'\n\n    id = Column(types.Integer, primary_key=True)\n    discriminator = Column(types.String(50), nullable=False)\n    child_id = Column(types.Integer)\n    child = relationship('A', primaryjoin='foreign(A.child_id) == remote(A.id)')\n\n    p_on = column_property(\n        case([\n            (discriminator == \"a\", \"a\"),\n        ], else_=\"b\"))\n\n    __mapper_args__ = {\n        'polymorphic_identity': 'a',\n        \"polymorphic_on\": p_on,\n    }\n\n\n\n```\n\n\nI need to go back and see what the guidance is on freestanding \"case()\" for polymorphic_on in the docs.  seems to work for all the other loaders including subqueryload.\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441934597/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441934606","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/3800#issuecomment-441934606","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/3800","id":441934606,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ0MTkzNDYwNg==","user":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/